flowchart LR
  Browser[Local browser UI] -->|same-origin HTTP| API[FastAPI + OpenCV 5]
  API --> Quality[Decode, quality, foreground]
  Quality --> Bank[Normal-only OpenCV feature bank]
  Bank --> Agent[Bounded deterministic agent]
  Agent -->|localized anomaly| Crop[inspect_crop on source pixels]
  Crop --> Agent
  Agent -->|low quality| Capture[Request new capture / review]
  API --> SQLite[Local SQLite audit + image artifacts]
  Eval[Seeded synthetic evaluator] -.held-out fixtures.-> Bank
  Cloud[AWS target: not deployed] -.blocked before deployment.-> API
